.THS News_out 8L News.SH NAME$N - gateways incoming news to mail..SH SYNOPSIS$N <receiver>.SH DESCRIPTIONIn combination with.B News_in$N can be used to forward news as mails and to allow answering to anarticle via mail. $N tries to set the.B Reply-To:line to a valid name (<group>\@newsgroup.<local-domain>) to allow asimple answer posting by the user..SH CAVEATSThis is only a very primitiv solution and may cause several problems.